 teach:'Slide 32 puts omeprazole among the inhibitors; slide 33 puts it among the inducers, for 1A1/2 and 3A4; slide 34 puts it first in the CYP2C19 inhibitor column. There is no conflict because the two actions fall on different isoforms. The same drug can therefore lower a CYP3A4 substrate\'s level and raise a CYP2C19 substrate\'s level.',
